      "@type": "Scene",
      "instance_name": "growth_comparison_scene",
      "label": "Growth Comparison Scene",
      "description": "A scene depicting Harvey Price at two different stages of his life, juxtaposed to illustrate physical growth over time. The top image shows him as a child in a movie poster, while the bottom image shows him as a slightly older child in front of a Burger King. The text 'this is how harvey price has grown over the years' frames the comparison. The scene includes Harvey_Price in both images, with the bottom image also featuring a white woman and two other children, creating a social context contrast.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_3f5ce183"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
