      "instance_name": "infantilization",
      "label": "Infantilization",
      "description": "Infantilization is the process of treating a person as if they are a child, regardless of their actual age or maturity level. The meme's focus on Harvey Price's physical growth can be seen as infantilizing, reducing his identity to a visual comparison of growth. This requires background knowledge about infantilization and its social implications.",
