      "instance_name": "objectification",
      "label": "Objectification",
      "description": "Objectification is the process of treating a person as an object, rather than as a person with agency and dignity. The meme's focus on Harvey Price's physical growth can be seen as objectifying, reducing his identity to a visual comparison of growth. This requires background knowledge about objectification and its social implications.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
